<title>TURKEY: Turk Demirbank to invest in Romania bank.</title>
<headline>Turk Demirbank to invest in Romania bank.</headline>
<dateline>ISTANBUL 1997-02-25</dateline>
<text>
<p>Turkey's medium-sized commercial bank Demirbank said it would be the major shareholder in a bank to be established in Romania.</p>
<p>In a statement sent to the Istanbul Stock Exchange, Demirbank said it would apply to the Romanian central bank to acquire a licence for the new Romanian bank which would have a capital of eight million dollars.</p>
<p>-- Istanbul newsroom +90-212-2750875</p>
</text>
